---Create a cancellation
---
---Cancels a function's runs queued between from and until, inclusive, with millisecond precision. until may be up to now plus five seconds. There is no cap on range width; a from far in the past includes all queued runs through until. Includes runs that have never started, even when the function is paused. Running runs stop before their next step; sleeping or waiting runs are cancelled when they next resume. A step already executing may finish. The optional if expression filters the triggering event. Returns 201 when created; cancellation happens asynchronously. Not idempotent: each request creates another cancellation.
---
---`POST /apps/{appId}/functions/{functionId}/cancellations`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden, NotFound.
---@param input inngest.inngest.CreateV2CancellationRequest
---@return inngest.inngest.V2CreateCancellationResponse? value
