---Pause a function
---
---Pauses a function. Idempotent: pausing a paused function returns 200 and changes nothing. Send no request body. Runs already executing may continue. In Cloud, the pause can take up to a minute to apply, new runs are skipped while paused, and runs still unfinished after 7 days paused are cancelled, same as pausing in the dashboard. Wait for a pause or resume to finish before sending the opposite action: requests sent close together can be skipped or apply out of order. Confirm with GetFunction after the cache has refreshed and retry if needed. In the dev server, the pause applies right away, new runs stay queued, and it lasts until resumed or restarted. Use PauseFunctions to pause up to 500 functions in one request.
---
---`POST /apps/{appId}/functions/{functionId}/pause`
---@param input inngest.inngest.PauseV2FunctionRequest
---@return inngest.inngest.V2PauseFunctionResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:pause_v2_function(input) end

---Pause functions
---
---Pauses functions in one app. Idempotent. Accepts up to 500 unique IDs, at most 256 bytes each, in a body of at most 256 KiB of JSON. Split larger sets into multiple requests. Cloud limits bulk calls to a lower rate (about 1 per 5 seconds on most plans), so quick retries can get a 429. Returns one result per ID in request order; failures do not stop the rest. An unknown app returns 200 with not_found for every ID, so check each result. The path app ID is used; any appId in the body is ignored. Running work may continue. In Cloud, pauses can take up to a minute to apply, new runs are skipped, and unfinished runs are cancelled after 7 days paused. In the dev server, pauses apply immediately, new runs stay queued, and pauses last until resumed or restarted. Wait for each pause or resume request to finish before sending the opposite action; confirm with GetFunction after the cache refreshes and retry if needed.
---
---`POST /apps/{appId}/functions/pause`
---@param input inngest.inngest.PauseV2FunctionsRequest
---@return inngest.inngest.V2PauseFunctionsResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:pause_v2_functions(input) end

