---Resume a function
---
---Resumes a paused function. Idempotent: resuming a function that is not paused returns 200 with isPaused: false. The dev server still wakes the queue so retries can recover a failed wake. Send no request body. In Cloud, the response reflects the requested state; the resume can take up to a minute to apply. A future scheduled pause returns 409 and is left unchanged. New runs skipped while paused are not recreated. Wait for a pause or resume to finish before sending the opposite action: requests sent close together can be skipped or apply out of order. Confirm with GetFunction after the cache has refreshed and retry if needed. In the dev server, resume clears the pause after waking the queue; a failed wake leaves the pause in place. Queued runs can then start. Use ResumeFunctions to resume up to 500 functions in one request.
---
---`POST /apps/{appId}/functions/{functionId}/resume`
---@param input inngest.inngest.ResumeV2FunctionRequest
---@return inngest.inngest.V2ResumeFunctionResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:resume_v2_function(input) end

---Resume functions
---
---Resumes functions in one app. Idempotent. Accepts up to 500 unique IDs, at most 256 bytes each, in a body of at most 256 KiB of JSON. Split larger sets into multiple requests. Cloud limits bulk calls to a lower rate (about 1 per 5 seconds on most plans), so quick retries can get a 429. Returns one result per ID in request order; failures do not stop the rest. An unknown app returns 200 with not_found for every ID, so check each result. The path app ID is used; any appId in the body is ignored. In Cloud, the response reflects the requested state; resumes can take up to a minute to apply. Future scheduled pauses return per-function errors and stay unchanged. Skipped runs are not recreated. In the dev server, each queue is woken before its pause is cleared; a failed wake leaves that function paused. Retries wake queues again. Wait for each pause or resume request to finish before sending the opposite action; confirm with GetFunction after the cache refreshes and retry if needed.
---
---`POST /apps/{appId}/functions/resume`
---@param input inngest.inngest.ResumeV2FunctionsRequest
